        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Bands: Giant Drag; Chagall Guevara\n- Places: Los Angeles, California\n- Releases: Lemona (EP)\n- People: Steve Taylor; Dave Perkins; Lynn Nichols; Wade Jaynes; Mike Mead; Phil Keaggy\n\nFacts:\n- Chagall Guevara was an American rock band formed in 1989 by Steve Taylor, Dave Perkins, Lynn Nichols, Wade Jaynes, and Mike Mead.\n- Dave Perkins and Lynn Nichols were associated with Phil Keaggy's 1970s band before joining Chagall Guevara.\n- Giant Drag is an American indie rock band from Los Angeles, California.\n- Lemona is the first release by the California indie rock band Giant Drag.",
